{"Title":"An Act designating a certain bridge in the city of Leominster as the Captain Ross A. Reynolds memorial bridge","BillNumber":"H3334","DocketNumber":"HD1253","GeneralCourtNumber":193,"PrimarySponsor":{"Id":"N_H1","Name":"Natalie M. Higgins","Type":1,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/LegislativeMembers/N_H1","ResponseDate":"2023-01-18T12:14:29.58"},"Cosponsors":[{"Id":"N_H1","Name":"Natalie M. Higgins","Type":1,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/LegislativeMembers/N_H1","ResponseDate":"2023-01-18T12:14:29.58"},{"Id":"JJC0","Name":"John J. Cronin","Type":1,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/LegislativeMembers/JJC0","ResponseDate":"2023-01-18T12:14:45.92"}],"JointSponsor":{"Id":"JJC0","Name":"John J. Cronin","Type":1,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/LegislativeMembers/JJC0","ResponseDate":"2023-01-18T12:14:29.58"},"BillHistory":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/Documents/H3334/DocumentHistoryActions","LegislationTypeName":"Bill","Pinslip":"By Representative Higgins of Leominster and Senator Cronin, a joint petition (accompanied by bill, House, No. 3334) of Natalie M. Higgins and John J. Cronin for legislation to designate a certain bridge in the city of Leominster as the Captain Ross A. Reynolds memorial bridge.  Transportation.","DocumentText":"\tSECTION 1. The bridge on the Leominster Connector Highway, over the North Nashua River, bridge number L08041, in the city of Leominster, shall be designated and known as the \"Captain Ross A. Reynolds Memorial Bridge\". \r\n\tSECTION 2. The Massachusetts Department of Transportation shall erect and maintain a suitable marker bearing the designation in compliance with the standards of the department.\r\n\tSECTION 3. This act shall take effect upon its passage.\r\n","EmergencyPreamble":null,"RollCalls":[],"Attachments":[],"CommitteeRecommendations":[{"Action":"Favorable","FiscalAmounts":[],"Committee":{"Comm